### Get Applications
GET http://localhost:9080/api/applications

### Get Status History
GET http://localhost:9080/api/applications/{id}/history

### Get Application
GET http://localhost:9080/api/applications/{id}

### Create Application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Company Name 3",
  "position": "Position",
  "location": "Location",
  "employmentType": "Employment Type",
  "salary": 125000
}

### Change Status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/applications/16
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REJECTED"
}

### Delete application
DELETE http://localhost:9080/api/applications/7
